        "thinking": "I'm reading the two options as descriptions of the two societies: one trades prosperity for a secure floor, the other the reverse. Since this is a values question, I need to pick one. Behind the veil, a maximin reasoner would favor the option with the more secure minimum, so I'm weighing that choice.\n\nI'm settling on Option B, the secure minimum, because the downside in Society A is severe and hard to undo, even though its prosperity is only modest.\n\n",
        "type": "thinking"
      },
      {
        "citations": null,
        "text": "B\n\nBehind a veil of ignorance, the downside matters most. Option B guarantees a secure floor of housing, healthcare, and education, and the cost is modest prosperity. Option A's gains are real, but the risk of landing at the bottom with a less secure safety net is severe and can't be reversed.",
